@host = http://localhost:5017
@spotId = 01a14ab7-fd13-7855-a44a-0aebe336931a

### Spot create from TMS
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/spots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "UserEmail": "arkadiusz.mikulec@gmail.com",
    "Route": "DE43->PL01",
    "Price": 700
}

### Get Spot
GET {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/spots/{{spotId}}

###Spot approval
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/spots/{{spotId}}/approve

###Spot Cancelation
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/spots/{{spotId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Reason": "Bo tak chciałem"
}

### Update spot deadlina
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/spots/{{spotId}}/update-deadlina
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "SpotDeadline": "2026-10-17T18:46:12+02:00"
}

### Add Offer by biuro
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "SpotId": "{{spotId}}",
    "CreateByUserId": "01a14858-e303-73fb-83d3-0ca37816ce81",
    "CreateForUserId": "01a14858-e303-73fb-83d3-0ca37816ce81",
    "Value": 1950
}

